WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.040
Every great anime needs a supreme evil organization
for the hero to defeat by the end of the story.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:12.900
And in One Piece, that big bad guy is the
ENTIRE World Government and Marine system.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:20.160
Which let me tell you this complex system
is SO MASSIVE with TONS of important characters

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:26.240
that it is sometimes incredibly difficult
to know if they are the final boss or a group

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.060
that we should be cheering for.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:37.820
So I’m going to explain how the entire organization
works and it all begins with the surprising

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:43.120
fact that the Marines as a whole are actually
not all that bad.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.730
Because one thing to keep in mind about this
group is that it is ABSOLUTELY ENORMOUS.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:56.210
And while we don’t have official numbers
there are most likely hundreds of thousands

00:00:56.210 --> 00:01:00.789
of marines who work hard to keep the peace
all around the world.

00:01:00.789 --> 00:01:07.970
Because despite all of the legendary clashes
we see in the main story, the marine's primary

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:14.791
role is to protect the one hundred and seventy
island kingdoms that are a part of the world

00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:15.970
government.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:21.479
These kingdoms all pay a heavenly tribute
to the world nobles to keep the protection

00:01:21.479 --> 00:01:23.200
of the marines.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:28.130
Plus they kinda get to vote on some things,
which we’ll discuss more about later on.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:35.130
But the Marines are actually incredibly necessary
for the normal people of the world because

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:40.930
if you live on some random island in the ocean
you probably don’t have many strong fighters

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:47.740
to protect yourselves, so having the Marines
around to fight off evil pirates is 100% a

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.180
good thing overall.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:55.200
Which makes it incredibly ironic that we mostly
view the Marines as bad guys because our main

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.380
character Luffy fights against them.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:05.289
However, we have to keep in mind that Luffy
is a pirate, and it is the marine's job to

00:02:05.289 --> 00:02:06.920
protect the world from pirates.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.660
I mean just think about it for a minute.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:16.610
Almost everywhere he goes he gets into GIGANTIC
FIGHTS that leave a HUGE mess for the island

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:17.750
to clean up.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:23.750
So if you are just a regular citizen or marine
and you don’t know the true reasons why

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:30.170
Luffy was fighting then you’d probably think
he was a bad guy as well.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.300
So that’s the basic job of the Marines.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:34.980
Protect people from pirates.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:41.129
And this is true basically everywhere except
for in the Grand Line, where many islands

00:02:41.129 --> 00:02:45.520
are mostly ruled by pirates which we’ll
talk more about that a bit later on.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.540
But how does the system actually work?

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.960
Well, to explain, let's work our way up through
the marine ranks.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:58.660
So imagine you are a good-hearted person who
just wants to help make the world a better

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.290
place, kinda like Koby here.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:08.940
To sign up you probably go to your local marine
base, which are scattered all across the oceans.

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:13.849
Unless you are already a well-known and super
powerful individual, you will more than likely

00:03:13.849 --> 00:03:17.519
be starting out at the very bottom rank as
a chore boy.

00:03:17.519 --> 00:03:22.140
Which means you’ll probably be spending
a good amount of time on a random marine base

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:27.030
or ship just helping out with the chores.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:32.750
Then after some time if you show some fighting
abilities you might be promoted to Seaman

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:36.560
Recruit, which means that you are now a common
soldier in the Marines.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:43.190
So instead of doing chores at a base or ship,
you are now thrown onto the front lines to

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.270
defend the people in your territory.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:52.930
Let’s just hope you don’t get one shot
by literally anyone strong.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:58.860
Now this is each marine’s basic job all
the way up through the Seaman Apprentice,

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:02.900
Seaman First Class, and even into the different
Petty and Warrant Officer ranks.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:09.720
But as you move up you’ll probably get more
responsibilities such as communicating orders

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:13.879
to lower rank soldiers and hopefully, there
are some benefits as well.

00:04:13.879 --> 00:04:18.049
In fact, the first time that we meet this
black-haired swords woman - who surprising

00:04:18.049 --> 00:04:24.160
looks like Zoro’s childhood friend - she
is a Master Chief Petty Officer who works

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:29.970
directly under a marine Captain, which makes
her second-in-command of the entire marine

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.860
base at Loguetown.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:38.600
So just like Tashigi here, you can have a
ton of responsibility even before you become

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.600
a Captain.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:44.800
At least in the four Blue Seas, where the
Marines are typically lower ranked until they

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.479
are promoted to the Grand Line.

00:04:47.479 --> 00:04:51.910
Although maybe it’s a good thing to stay
around here because as we will see in just

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:57.259
a moment, the higher you rise, the more corrupt
the organization becomes.

00:04:57.259 --> 00:05:02.759
But let’s now jump into the actual commissioned
officers starting with Ensign.

00:05:02.759 --> 00:05:06.539
Now we are going to stick with Tashigi for
this rank because when we saw her during the

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:11.550
Post-Enies Lobby arc, she had recently obtained
this rank.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:15.759
Which to be fair I’m not sure how much more
authority this gave her, but I’d assume

00:05:15.759 --> 00:05:20.490
that she can give orders to a larger group
of marines and they likely have a certain

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.419
area of the sea to patrol.

00:05:22.419 --> 00:05:29.580
Plus she is in the Grand Line now, so the
average pirate she will fight is WAY STRONGER.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:34.360
And that’s clearly what we see her doing
because it looks like she and her allies just

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.300
finished protecting an island from a group
of pirates.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:42.539
But that still doesn’t mean that she has
much freedom to make her own choices in the

00:05:42.539 --> 00:05:43.539
Marines.

00:05:43.539 --> 00:05:49.500
So if you want to actually have any independence,
how high do you need to go?

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:54.789
Well, let’s skip ahead to the rank of Captain
and see how great having some independence

00:05:54.789 --> 00:06:00.650
turns out because it is at this rank that
many Captains get to control their very own

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:01.650
Marine base.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:06.160
Which can be an ABSOLUTE DISASTER for the
people living around the base.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:11.699
For example, the very first Captain we meet
in the story is this ax-handed captain of

00:06:11.699 --> 00:06:16.960
the 153rd Marine branch, but this dude was
literally evil.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:22.740
He would heavily tax the villagers, execute
people for talking back to his son, and build

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:26.270
giant statues of himself just to satisfy his
pride.

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:31.550
And if you’re thinking that’s just one
random example of a corrupt Captain, well

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:35.830
there’s also this cat-faced captain who
was SUPPOSED to help free Nami’s village

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:41.150
from this evil Fishmen crew, but he instead
accepted a bribe and stole all of Nami’s

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:42.840
hard earned money instead.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:48.479
Wow, these guys are just plain awful, which
might make you wonder how they even got their

00:06:48.479 --> 00:06:50.170
ranks in the first place.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:54.940
Well, as we’ll see later on the only thing
that really matters to marines is your fighting

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:55.940
strength.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:07:01.129
So as long as you can prove yourself in combat
you will probably keep rising through the

00:07:01.129 --> 00:07:02.129
marine ranks.

00:07:02.129 --> 00:07:06.150
Which is a stupidly messed up system.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:10.199
But Captains can also be out on patrol.

00:07:10.199 --> 00:07:14.650
And in the Grand Line the rank of Captain
is basically the lowest rank marine who can

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:19.419
put up a decent fight against important pirates.

00:07:19.419 --> 00:07:24.770
Everyone else gets completely washed.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:30.840
Which brings us to Commodores, which is the
rank just below the all-important admiral-type

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:31.840
ranks.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:36.470
Normally these marines are just higher-ranking
Captains who have similar duties, but there

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:41.449
are a few notable Commodores who deal with
special matters that are too important for

00:07:41.449 --> 00:07:42.580
lower rank marines.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:48.569
For example, this Commodore is in charge of
assigning bounties to pirates all across the

00:07:48.569 --> 00:07:49.569
world.

00:07:49.569 --> 00:07:53.660
However, they still lack the freedom of higher
ranking marines, as we saw when this chain-smoking

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:58.509
Marine was a Commodore and he complained that
he still needed a higher rank to accomplish

00:07:58.509 --> 00:08:01.480
his goal of chasing the straw hats into the
New World.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:07.139
But now we are getting to a whole new tier
of marines with the rank of Rear Admiral.

00:08:07.139 --> 00:08:12.300
At this rank, we are well past your common
marines because these characters are fighters

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.860
who can be trusted to hold their own against
strong pirates.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:21.580
For example, this ruthless lady marine is
now a Rear Admiral as is this clay-using marine

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:27.069
that we recently met in the manga, who has
command of one of the most important marine

00:08:27.069 --> 00:08:31.819
bases that is located right next to many of
the Yonko territories.

00:08:31.819 --> 00:08:38.229
However, even these strong Rear Admirals ARE
NOTHING COMPARED to the next rank which is

00:08:38.229 --> 00:08:40.500
of course the Vice-Admirals.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.020
Not only is this the rank with the most current
known members, but they are essentially the

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:50.010
group of marines trusted with special missions
such as when this guy was sent to bring the

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:54.290
Pirate Empress to Marineford and they were
the largest group of strong marines during

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:55.620
the war at Marineford.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:09:01.360
Vice-Admirals are also in charge of massive
fleets of marine battleships, which we see

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:08.890
put to devastating effect when five Vice-Admirals
are sent on a Buster Call like at Enies Lobby.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:14.000
Vice-Admirals are the first rank to actually
have some degree of flexibility.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.610
For example, when this smoking dude finally
achieves this rank, he can finally fulfill

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.910
his wish of chasing after the straw hats.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:27.510
Then of course there is the hero of the Marines,
Garp, who basically does whatever he wants

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:28.680
as a Vice-Admiral.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:34.420
Although we do see him following orders from
time to time such as when he escorted the

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:37.899
Fishmen royalty to the meeting of the world’s
rulers.

00:09:37.899 --> 00:09:42.190
Interestingly, Vice-Admirals are confirmed
to be excellent fighters.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:47.399
Many of them have devil fruits, but it is
also officially confirmed that they all know

00:09:47.399 --> 00:09:48.940
some form of haki.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:57.070
But with all that being said, there are galaxies
of difference between the Vice-Admirals and

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.120
the next rank.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:03.290
Which is of course the Admiral tier, which
you can take a shortcut to by subscribing

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.700
to the channel for more One Piece content
just like this.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:12.000
Seriously though, the admirals are commonly
referred to as the Greatest Powers in the

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.890
Marines, and for good reason.

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:21.300
To be promoted to the rank of admiral means
that you are one of the strongest fighters

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.050
in the entire world.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:27.820
In fact, there are only ever three of these
positions at one time, and we’ve seen throughout

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:33.500
the story that these marines are devastatingly
powerful in a fight and possess some of the

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:36.420
most broken devil fruits.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:41.310
Admirals like the light fruit user Kizaru
have nearly killed Luffy multiple times and

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:44.750
even the former admiral Aokiji easily defeated
Luffy.

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:50.790
So these dudes are not people you should mess
around with.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:55.970
They do have a ton of responsibility though,
as they are essentially the bodyguards of

00:10:55.970 --> 00:11:00.440
the world nobles, who we’ll talk about in
just a moment, and whenever there is a Yonko

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:06.300
level threat, the admirals are the ones who
are sent in to deal with the problem.

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:11.339
Each admiral also has their own personal style
of Justice, which influences the actions that

00:11:11.339 --> 00:11:12.339
they take.

00:11:12.339 --> 00:11:16.450
For example, Aokiji’s justice is Lazy Justice,
which means that he will sometimes follow

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:20.250
orders and other times do what he thinks is
best.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:33.660
And we saw this when he let Robin escape from
the destruction of her home island.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:44.959
But there is one even higher rank in the Marines
and that is the position of Fleet Admiral.

00:11:44.959 --> 00:11:51.779
Which if I’m being honest, I would not want
this job at all, because even the super aggressive

00:11:51.779 --> 00:11:59.690
magma fruit using Akainu went from being a
one-man army as an admiral to being a pencil-pushing

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.529
administrator ever since he got this fleet
admiral job during the time skip.

00:12:03.529 --> 00:12:09.130
Although he does get to set the main philosophy
of the marines, which in this case means that

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:13.220
the marines now follow Akainu’s Absolute
Justice.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:20.829
This change in philosophy means that now the
entire marine organization is much more cutthroat

00:12:20.829 --> 00:12:27.050
and willing to do whatever it takes to kill
pirates, even if that requires doing some

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.649
evil things along the way.

00:12:28.649 --> 00:12:32.190
And altogether that is the main structure
of the marines.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:36.579
But you might be surprised to know that they
are just one single pillar of what makes up

00:12:36.579 --> 00:12:39.980
the entire World Government military forces.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:44.690
That’s because there are actually two other
super important branches of the military that

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.769
affect the world in different ways.

00:12:46.769 --> 00:12:54.000
The first is the legendary Cipher Pol organization,
whose main jobs involve investigations, spying,

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.310
and assassinations.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:58.540
There are currently six known Cipher Pol groups.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:02.709
The most known of these groups is CP9, who
were the Straw Hat’s main enemies during

00:13:02.709 --> 00:13:04.850
the Water 7 and Enies Lobby arcs.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:10.870
This particular group specialized in assassinations,
but they were also secret agents who spent

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:15.399
YEARS working undercover to find the blueprints
to the ancient weapon Pluton.

00:13:15.399 --> 00:13:20.350
That’s not even the strongest group though
because after the time skip we were introduced

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:26.680
to CP0, which if I’m being honest is essentially
made up of most of the old CP9 agents.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:31.310
What’s special about this group is that
they work directly for the world nobles, which

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:36.550
if you know anything about those scumbags
then you should know they are up to no good.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:43.390
In fact, we’ve even seen some of the shadiest
dealings of the world government involving

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:49.290
CP0 such as when they were negotiating with
the evil Shogun of Wano and the Emperor Kaido

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:55.000
to buy weapons and when they were purchasing
orphans from this old lady to train them to

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.820
become government agents.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:14:02.450
So clearly this branch of the world government
has much more to do with the corruption of

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.680
the entire system than any other group we’ve
talked about before.

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:10.320
That’s not even the worst part though because
the other main pillar of the World Government

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:14.089
forces is the entire Warlord system.

00:14:14.089 --> 00:14:19.920
And let me tell you this system was completely
messed up from the start.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:24.449
If you don’t know, the way it works is that
the World Government invites certain pirates

00:14:24.449 --> 00:14:25.930
to work for them.

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:31.000
And once a pirate becomes a Warlord, they
basically get to do whatever they want without

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.870
any consequences from the Marines.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:39.330
For example, the Warlords Crocodile and Doflamingo
essentially took over entire kingdoms, but

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:42.600
the marines were restricted from doing anything
to stop them.

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:47.740
However, in exchange for this freedom, the
Warlords must fight for the world government

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.580
whenever they are called.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:54.889
And we really only saw this happen during
the war at Marineford, where the Warlords

00:14:54.889 --> 00:14:58.230
helped the Marines fight against the Emperor
Whitebeard.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:04.250
And this is the perfect time to mention that
the Marines, Warlords, and Yonko make up what

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.649
is called the Three Powers of the One Piece
World.

00:15:07.649 --> 00:15:13.200
This idea is that the combined strength of
the Marines and Warlords helps balance out

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.680
the power of the Yonko.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:20.420
And with this balance, the strongest pirates
usually stay in their territories in the Grand

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:24.370
Line which keeps the world from being thrown
into chaos.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:30.459
Which worked out pretty well until the Warlord
system was thrown in the garbage because of

00:15:30.459 --> 00:15:33.490
the awful things that some of the Warlords
did.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:37.680
But that system was quickly replaced by the
new Special Science Group which is made up

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:41.649
of some of the MOST INSANE technology the
world has ever seen.

00:15:41.649 --> 00:15:46.069
That’s because the Genius scientist of the
world government has invented an entire army

00:15:46.069 --> 00:15:51.259
of super strong cyborgs who can shoot laser
beams plus there are these ultra-powerful

00:15:51.259 --> 00:15:55.700
clones that have devil fruit powers and basically
cannot be destroyed.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:16:01.660
And with all this incredibly destructive technology,
the World Government is a bigger threat than

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:02.660
ever before.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:07.710
Oh, and there’s one more special group of
the Marines I haven’t mentioned yet.

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:12.310
This group is called Sword and they are marines
who have officially given up their marine

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:17.440
status, but who still work towards the overall
good of the marine organization.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:22.399
The only difference is that they are not restricted
by marine orders.

00:16:22.399 --> 00:16:27.310
But that unfortunately means that a Sword
member will not be saved by the marines if

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.570
they get into trouble.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:33.889
This was perfectly shown by this Sword member,
who went undercover as a pirate, joined an

00:16:33.889 --> 00:16:37.709
Emperor’s crew, but then turned against
Kaido when the straw hats came to defeat the

00:16:37.709 --> 00:16:39.649
Emperor during Wano.

00:16:39.649 --> 00:16:46.930
And EVERY SINGLE group that I just mentioned
is directly under the control of this guy

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:53.519
who is the Commander in Chief of the World
Government.

00:16:53.519 --> 00:17:00.770
Which means that he can basically give orders
to anyone who works for the World Government.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:07.930
But his main role is to act as a go-between
for the military forces and the world nobles.

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:14.821
And CAN YOU EVEN IMAGINE the insane amount
of ridiculous requests he gets from the World

00:17:14.821 --> 00:17:15.821
Nobles?

00:17:15.821 --> 00:17:20.890
Because if the entire group of them are similar
to the ones we have already met, then they

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:27.150
have got to be the most selfish, idiotic,
spoiled group of individuals on the planet.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:32.310
Which you may be wondering how it is even
possible that these people came to be in charge

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:33.870
in the first place.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:39.130
Well, the answer is that these people are
the descendants of the original twenty kingdoms

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:46.010
who founded the world government over 800
years ago.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.880
Since that time the world nobles have lived
up on top of the Red line, where they hold

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:53.160
absolute power over the world.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:59.539
That includes the freedom to keep slaves,
kidnap, murder, and waste stupid amounts of

00:17:59.539 --> 00:18:03.610
money on ridiculous things.

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:08.669
They can also give orders to the Marines and
cipher pol, plus they are protected everywhere

00:18:08.669 --> 00:18:09.940
they go.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:16.370
However, they do seem to have some of their
own laws that they must follow.

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:20.890
And we only know that because recently in
the manga we were introduced to a brand new

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:25.309
group of government soldiers called the Holy
Knights.

00:18:25.309 --> 00:18:30.180
And this group seems to be made up of super
strong World Nobles who have the power to

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:33.400
enforce justice among themselves.

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:39.730
Which we can clearly see when they even kill
one of their own for a certain crime.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:45.000
Which honestly it seemed impossible that something
like this could happen to these untouchable

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.000
figures.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:49.480
But these Holy Knights are not even the highest
ranking World Nobles.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:56.280
That’s because the main group of nobles
that we always see making decisions are these

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.419
five old men right here.

00:18:58.419 --> 00:19:04.830
These are the Gorosei, or the Five Elder Stars.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:13.580
And this is where the corruption of the world
government truly runs deep because this group

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:19.169
uses all the military forces of the world
government to protect their deepest darkest

00:19:19.169 --> 00:19:21.690
secrets, which we’ll talk about in just
a moment.

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:26.260
First though we have to ask, just who are
these five old men?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:31.590
Well, we know that they are World Nobles,
although unlike the rest they don’t wear

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.050
those weird space suits.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:37.549
Plus we only recently learned their names
and their official government duties in the

00:19:37.549 --> 00:19:42.039
manga, and we also don’t know how they were
chosen to be part of the Gorosei.

00:19:42.039 --> 00:19:47.820
But the MOST IMPORTANT question that is still
unanswered is if they have actually been alive

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:51.560
ever since the World Government was formed
800 years ago.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:57.770
I mean the way they talk sometimes makes it
seem like they are immortal gods who view

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:00.390
the races of the world as playthings.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:05.789
But if they were immortal then surely someone
would have noticed if these dudes ever age

00:20:05.789 --> 00:20:08.640
since they are sometimes seen meeting with
other people.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:13.250
However, that is not even the most mysterious
part about them because as we’ve been shown

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:19.830
throughout the story the Gorosei will do ANYTHING
to protect the secrets of the Void Century.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:24.870
If you don’t know, this time period occurred
between nine and eight hundred years ago,

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:30.190
but all history of it has literally been erased.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:33.190
There is no mention of anything during this
time.

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:39.309
However there is ONE MAJOR EXCEPTION, and
that is these unbreakable stone writings called

00:20:39.309 --> 00:20:44.400
the poneglyphs which actually record the true
history of the Void Century.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:50.630
Plus they point towards the direction of Laugh
Tale and the One Piece Treasure.

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:56.110
So yeah, these things are a SERIOUS PROBLEM
for the Gorosei, which makes it a little odd

00:20:56.110 --> 00:21:00.659
that after eight hundred years they still
haven’t managed to go around and collect

00:21:00.659 --> 00:21:02.049
all of these things.

00:21:02.049 --> 00:21:07.490
But whatever the true history is, even it
will probably not be as shocking as the ultimate

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.780
power of the world government.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:13.529
By the way, a major spoiler warning here if
you aren’t caught up to at least the start

00:21:13.529 --> 00:21:19.821
of the Wano arc, but in chapter 906 of the
manga it was revealed that there is a actually

00:21:19.821 --> 00:21:27.350
secret ruler of the World Government named
Imu who can make even the Gorosei bow down

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:30.360
and listen to their orders.

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:36.559
Seriously, this mysterious person has ALL
THE POWER.

00:21:36.559 --> 00:21:39.760
If Imu wants a nearby kingdom wiped off the
map.

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:40.760
They do it.

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:43.950
If Imu wants a certain princess of a kingdom
to be kidnapped.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:44.950
It is done.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:48.800
They literally have control over EVERYTHING.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:55.150
So funnily enough, what is supposed to be
a government where 170 kingdoms come together

00:21:55.150 --> 00:22:00.320
every four years to vote on important issues
is truthfully controlled by the world nobles

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:06.620
who are just puppets for this mysterious figure
who we still are waiting to learn more about.

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:11.309
You can kind of think about it like a bad
apple, where on the outside it looks pretty

00:22:11.309 --> 00:22:18.020
delicious just like most of the marines are
good people, but once you get inside the apple

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:22.370
it turns out to be completely rotten to the
core.

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:26.860
But now that we’ve reached the top of the
World Government structure there are some

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.870
other SUPER IMPORTANT details to mention.

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:34.799
The first is that the government also controls
the justice system which includes the justice

00:22:34.799 --> 00:22:39.270
island of Enies Lobby, where criminals are
tried in “court” - which is completely

00:22:39.270 --> 00:22:44.010
corrupt by the way - before being sent to
the underwater prison Impel Down.

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:48.230
And as you can see during the Impel Down arc,
this is where the worst pirates and criminals

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:51.880
are sent to be tortured until they die.

00:22:51.880 --> 00:22:57.020
Also, I mentioned the founding of the World
Government, but it is worth spending a little

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:02.370
more time on because this history is absolutely
going to play a major role in the final saga

00:23:02.370 --> 00:23:03.370
of the story.

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:07.170
That’s because from what little we know
there was a major war way back during the

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:08.720
Void Century.

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:12.929
The original twenty kingdoms of the World
Government fought against an unknown group

00:23:12.929 --> 00:23:17.510
that was most likely led by the legendary
figure, Joy Boy. which if you’ve been on

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:23.390
the internet at all recently, you probably
know that Luffy has now inherited the title

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:28.429
of Joy Boy, so we simply MUST learn more about
this time period and how the world government

00:23:28.429 --> 00:23:30.490
actually gained their power.

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:34.910
I mean if they’ve spent so much time and
effort keeping the information hidden, it

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:40.770
must be something incredibly dark that they
absolutely don’t want the world to know.

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:46.340
Plus, we also recently learned that the One
Piece World used to be WAY MORE technologically

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:48.190
advanced than it is now.

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:54.750
In fact, the world had giant robots, lasers,
cloning technology, possibly space travel,

00:23:54.750 --> 00:24:00.190
and way more awesome stuff that the world
is only now starting to relearn how to do.

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:05.240
So there must be some reason why the world
government wanted to send the world back to

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:09.980
basically the stone age when they began their
rule 800 years ago.

00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:15.520
On top of that, there are also the secrets
of devil fruits which are also probably tied

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:19.390
to this time period, so I simply cannot wait
for all of these secrets to be revealed to

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:20.450
the world.

00:24:20.450 --> 00:24:25.350
But we cannot mention the world government
and marines without also bringing up the main

00:24:25.350 --> 00:24:26.350
groups who oppose them.

00:24:26.350 --> 00:24:30.740
There are of course pirates like Luffy and
the Yonko who have major influence in the

00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:35.110
world, but honestly these groups aren’t
seriously trying to take each other out.

00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:39.520
They only sometimes come into major conflicts
like Marineford.

00:24:39.520 --> 00:24:44.750
More importantly though is the revolutionary
army led by Luffy’s father, Dragon, whose

00:24:44.750 --> 00:24:48.070
sole mission is to take down the corrupt World
Nobles.

00:24:48.070 --> 00:24:52.910
Which the specific wording of this is important
because they don’t actually want to destroy

00:24:52.910 --> 00:24:57.430
the Marines, just the evil rulers who sit
at the top of it all.

00:24:57.430 --> 00:25:01.710
In fact, only recently have they actually
gone head to head against the world government

00:25:01.710 --> 00:25:03.760
in a fight.

00:25:03.760 --> 00:25:08.290
For most of the story, the revolutionary army
has been focused on convincing kingdoms all

00:25:08.290 --> 00:25:12.230
around the world to leave the world government
and join their revolution.

00:25:12.230 --> 00:25:17.390
Which is the exact reason that this kingdom
got completely wiped off the map.

00:25:17.390 --> 00:25:21.070
And with this weapon capable of destroying
islands in the world government’s hands,

00:25:21.070 --> 00:25:25.610
it is going to take a ton of firepower to
eventually defeat them.

00:25:25.610 --> 00:25:30.890
But luckily the one piece world has one of
the most impressive power systems in all of

00:25:30.890 --> 00:25:37.520
anime with a HUGE variety of powers like Haki,
Devil fruits, Science and even more.

00:25:37.520 --> 00:25:43.320
So if you want a complete breakdown of this
INCREDIBLE AND COMPLEX power system, you can

00:25:43.320 --> 00:25:45.860
watch this video right here.

00:25:45.860 --> 00:25:49.070
Shanks for watching, and I’ll see you in
the next one.

